## CLI surface (names finalized during implementation)

```
tow [PATH...]
  -a, --all             include hidden files
  --no-gitignore        include gitignored files
  -L, --max-depth N     depth limit
  -d, --dirs-only
  -f, --full-path
  --limit N             files shown per type per dir (default 2)
  --sort NAME|MTIME|COMMITS|SIZE|VERSION|NONE
  --select IMPORTANT|RECENT|MODIFIED|NAME   (option 1-4; default IMPORTANT)
  -r, --reverse  --dirsfirst  --filesfirst
  --commits / --no-commits
  --recent [N]
  -h  --si  -s  --du    sizes / dir accumulation
  -D, --timefmt FORMAT
  -P PATTERN  -I PATTERN
  --prune  --noreport
  -C / -n / --color auto|always|never
```

### `tree` options ported vs skipped

Ported (prioritized): `-a`, gitignore (inverted default), `-L`, `-d`, `-f`,
`--filelimit` (core mechanism), `-I`/`-P`, `-h`/`--si`/`-s`/`--du`,
`--dirsfirst`/`--filesfirst`/`--sort`/`-t`/`-r`, `-D`/`--timefmt`, `-F`/`-p`/`-u`/`-g`
(later), `-i`/`-A`/`--charset` (later), `-n`/`-C`/`NO_COLOR`, `--noreport`, `--prune`,
`-x` (later).

Skipped for v1: `-J`/`-X`/`-H` (JSON/XML/HTML), `--fromfile`, `--info`, `--hyperlink`.

