## Architecture / module layout

```
src/
  main.rs      — entry, wiring
  cli.rs       — clap derive struct (all options + help)
  model.rs     — in-memory tree: Node { Dir | File }, size, git metadata
  walk.rs      — traversal via `ignore` crate (gitignore, hidden, depth, filelimit)
  filter.rs    — -P/-I patterns, --no-gitignore, prune
  select.rs    — "exemplary file" selection + per-type hidden-file summary
  important.rs — recognized-file heuristics (README, Cargo.toml, package.json, …)
  sort.rs      — name/mtime/commit-time/size ordering + dirsfirst/filesfirst
  git.rs       — last-commit-per-file via git2; recent-file mode
  size.rs      — human/SI size + --du accumulation
  color.rs     — file-type → color (LS_COLORS + built-in fallback + extension table)
  render.rs    — tree lines, indentation, aligned metadata columns, report
  error.rs     — error type
```

**Data flow:** parse args → build `ignore::WalkBuilder` → walk into an in-memory `Node`
tree → (optional) resolve git repo root and annotate last-commit per file → select
exemplary files per directory → compute "N files / T types not shown" → render + final
report.

### Dependencies

- **clap** (derive) — CLI
- **ignore** — gitignore-aware, hidden-file, parallel walking (ripgrep's crate)
- **anstream / anstyle** — tty auto-detection + ANSI color
- **lscolors** — parse `LS_COLORS`
- **git2** — git history
- **jiff** (or `time`) — commit timestamps + `--timefmt` formatting, timezone-aware
- **unicode-width** — correct column alignment for non-ASCII filenames
- dev: **tempfile**, **assert_cmd**, **predicates**, **insta**

Rust edition 2024 (rustc 1.85+).

